    "renderMode": 10,
    "scriptCode": "// --- SPHERE <-> CUBE MORPHING (Implicit mode) ---\n// Use slider A to grow or shrink the shape\n\nfloat size = A > 0.0 ? A : 0.8;\n\n// Distance for the Sphere\nfloat dSphere = length(p) - size;\n\n// Distance for the Cube (exact Box)\nvec3 d = abs(p) - vec3(size);\nfloat dBox = length(max(d, 0.0)) + min(max(d.x, max(d.y, d.z)), 0.0);\n\n// Use time 't' to build an interpolation factor (from 0 to 1)\n// sin(t) ranges from -1 to 1, so we remap it\nfloat morphFactor = 0.5 + 0.5 * sin(t * 2.0);\n\n// Mix the two shapes!\nreturn mix(dSphere, dBox, morphFactor);\n",
